==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Shachiko]] spawns after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Techn-Old Hyena]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**2 [[Doctor K.O.]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a simple Dark Dober stage with Techn-old Hyena and Shachiko as the main support. When Dark Dober spawns, burst him down with units like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazer]], Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] and a well-timed Talented [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. He should hopefully die before Techn-old Hyena makes his way to your front-lines, and if he doesn't, use Talented [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to take him down while damaging Techn-old Hyena in the process. Afterwards, the clean up phase shouldn't be too difficult, just make sure to use [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] for Shachiko.

==Trivia==
*Renovated Shipwreck and [[Jetsam Lookout]] are typical [[Zero Legends]] stages, in contrast to how [[Floating Bus Stop]] and [[Ink Museum]] are designed like late [[Stories of Legend]] stages and [[Coral Housing]] and [[Kelp Campsite]] are designed like [[Uncanny Legends]] stages.

